<br />

<br />
Cottage deed, 1 platinum (1000 gold)
<br />
House deed, 10 p (10,000 g)
<br />
Villa deed, 50 p (50,000 g)
<br />
Mansion deed, 100 p (100,000 g)
<br />

<br />
The rent costs per week of the houses are two percent of their initial cost.
<br />

<br />
